// Hash trait — hashing for map/set keys
// Declaration only. Per D9 this is a derivable trait; impls live with each
// type (see Bool.camp, Str.camp, Char.camp, Result.camp, etc.). This module
// defines the interface contract, not any implementations.
//
// Per D29: Hasher is opaque (SipHash-1-3 internally). Per D29 `Hash(a)` stays
// single-parameter. Hasher construction and finalization are runtime concerns.

@Hasher : {}

Hash : {
  hash : |Self, Hasher| -> Hasher,
}

// Tests
test "Hash trait interface declaration compiles" {
  expect True
}
